      "id": "scope",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Source and tracking contract",
      "description": "Original project fixtures and graph (MIT), generated by build_example.py. Green target positions and scale changes are independently defined in truth.json; the red distractor is deliberately a different color. First frame teaches, then accepted frames yield current-ticket geometry. CamShift ellipse sizes describe color mass, not physical part dimensions; principal axes have 180-degree ambiguity. After three lost frames, expiry requires explicit reset/reseed. No customer or third-party image content; no robust identity claim for same-color distractors.",
